description	"Dark Jedi 

3-life Sith with customizable Force Powers and Lightsaber attributes.

^2Weaponry: 
- Melee
- Lightsaber (Yellow)
-- Short Saber (Yellow/Red)
-- Dual Shotos (Duals/Purple)
-- Single Shoto (Blue/Cyan)
-- Double Bladed (Staff)
-- Lower Damage Heavy Styles, Higher Damage Light Styles
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (2)
- Force Focus (2)
- Assemble (2)"